{"id":"e74d4f391e777166","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-low2-domination.md","title":"Low2 的相对支配表征","display":"thm-low2-domination — Low2 的相对支配表征","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-low2-domination","aliases":["20-thm-low2-domination"],"display":"thm-low2-domination — Low2 的相对支配表征","chapter":"4","section":"4.6","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 4.6.1","source_pdf_pages":[134],"source_printed_pages":[98],"depends_on":["[[20-df-low-high]]","[[20-df-domination]]","[[20-thm-martin-high]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-low2-domination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-low2-domination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-low2-domination — Low2 的相对支配表征"},{"key":"chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"section","html":"4.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 4.6.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>134</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>98</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7f202b538b169b2\" href=\"?note=c7f202b538b169b2\" title=\"20-thm-martin-high\">20-thm-martin-high</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"91065cedbdf2fc27\" href=\"?note=91065cedbdf2fc27\" title=\"20-df-low-high\">20-df-low-high</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c7f202b538b169b2\" href=\"?note=c7f202b538b169b2\" title=\"20-thm-martin-high\">20-thm-martin-high</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low2\\text{-}domination}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Low}_2(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists g\\in(\\mathcal C_1^{\\varnothing&#39;})^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\forall f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [f\\le^*g].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}low2\\text{-}domination}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Low}_2(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists g\\in(\\mathcal C_1^{\\varnothing&#39;})^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\forall f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [f\\le^*g].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将 Martin 定理相对化到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为基底的锥中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 的相对 high 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;&#39;\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\">\\(A&#39;&#39;\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;&#39;\\)</span>。另一方向不等式总成立。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 4.6.1；印刷页 98；PDF 第 134 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-low-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-domination]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-martin-high","status":"resolved","id":"c7f202b538b169b2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-martin-high]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-low-high","status":"resolved","id":"91065cedbdf2fc27","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-thm-martin-high]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-domination","status":"resolved","id":"2e0726b34b0b1c40","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-domination]]；see [[20-thm-martin-high]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-martin-high","status":"resolved","id":"c7f202